  "notes": "Implemented api/src/ai (feature shared-ai-key; ai_credentials migration 0107; sealed own key; shared env key + app_settings.aiSharedModel; 5 adapters; /ai contracts+handlers; catalog). Evidence: ev q8kf verification — typecheck+lint green, shared 176, client 1246, admin 20, api 1263 pass.\nIndependent review of 9eff45c found 8 problems (attached review-q8kf.md); sent back to the omp session for fixes. Not approved.\nReview fixes applied: Anthropic sampling/thinking/max_input_tokens, authenticated verifyKey (OpenRouter /key), Z.ai manual-choice, /ai/models provider guard, fixed error messages + Retry-After, provider bound in AAD, shared-model consistency, OpenAI chat filter. ai tests 57 pass/0 skip/0 fail on :55432; full api 1275 pass.\nMerged main (3cbf4b3) into tk/budget-q8kf as merge commit 0d3d27c, no rebase. Renumbered 0107_ai_credentials.sql -> 0109_ai_credentials.sql (commit 2ed8baf) because main released 0107_connection_account_backfill and 0108_transfer_suggestions; updated the file header, MIGRATION_SIGNATURES, ai/store.ts comment and docs/architecture.md. Resolved the migrate.ts conflict keeping 0107, 0108 and 0109 signatures in order. Checked auto-merges: access.test.ts (AI ops + main's transfer ops in notBudgetAddressed), catalog-outputs.test.ts (AI samples + transfer suggestion seed/samples), shared/src/errors.ts + en/pt-BR (AI and transfer_* codes/strings all present), client profile features test. Verification in the worktree: task typecheck ok; task lint ok; shared 203 pass/0 skip/0 fail; client 1267 pass/0 skip/0 fail; admin 20 pass/0 skip/0 fail; api (BUDGET_REQUIRE_TEST_DB=1, BUDGET_TEST_PG_BASE=:55432) 1332 pass/0 skip/0 fail; migrate.test.ts 4 pass and schema_migrations on budgetnew_test_c85f2ef6 holds 0107, 0108, 0109 with public.ai_credentials present.\nAI provider layer merged to main as 05e3267 (local, not pushed); owner approved in chat on 2026-11-24. api/src/ai: feature shared-ai-key, ai_credentials (migration 0109), sealed own